        "created_at": "2023-08-10T16:39:01.345Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Writing a new web app when typing numbers into a PowerPoint or Google slide would have sufficed?! That <em>is</em> going above and beyond.</p>\n<p>This makes me want to hear a Trevor and Jean-Marc music-off, where they each get a list of prompts and have a limited time to produce results. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"></p>",
